%%{init: {"theme": "dark", "flowchart": {"curve": "basis"}}}%%
flowchart LR
  A([Inbound message]) --> B{Known person?}
  B -->|yes| C[Load memory]
  B -->|no| D[Create person]
  D --> C
  C --> E[[Agent turn]]
  E --> F>Reply drafted]
  classDef hot fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
  classDef cold fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#1d4ed8
  class A,F hot
  class D cold
  style E stroke-width:3px,stroke-dasharray: 4 2
  linkStyle 0 stroke:#ef4444
  click C "https://example.com/memory" "Memory docs"
